  "$darkOnlyByDesign": "This product has no light theme in V1. The persona this system is built for (bright sun on open water, or pre-dawn dark) makes a light UI actively harmful in the primary use case (a light background loses its remaining contrast headroom to reflected glare) and unnecessary in the secondary one (dark works before dawn too). Every token below repeats its single value under both 'light' and 'dark' rather than leaving 'light' unset, so the generator's light/dark contract (ADR 005 #2) is satisfied honestly instead of by omission. If a real light mode is designed later, only the 'light' values below change -- this is a placeholder duplication, not a design decision to have two identical themes.",
